{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>各位臘腸狗迷注意！曼谷最近新開咗「Bornz Too Dachshund House」，店入面有大約 20 至 30 隻超可愛嘅臘腸狗陪你玩！想像吓一大群小短腿喺你身邊穿梭跑嚟跑去，簡直係療癒感爆棚，去到真係會失控尖叫 🤣！</p><p>咖啡店目前處於試營運階段，設有室內同戶外兩大互動空間。試業期間門票200泰銖（約港幣$50，包一杯飲品），室內互動時段為 11:00 至 17:30，到了傍晚仲可以去戶外草地睇狗狗奔跑放電。交通亦非常方便，搭 BTS 即可到達。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178836486380891619_15099325096a98484033c90.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178836486584182134_16235257426a9848423a4e1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178836486752871106_2647774976a984844395db.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178836487054418655_11702130486a984846f2bcb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178836487257161627_11718058816a984848e2e5f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178836487436295615_18943185966a98484b57ead.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178836487740157033_17738895866a98484defad1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T16:24:05.643649+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":300,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}